@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - James McNeil</PageTitle>

<section class="about-page">
    <div class="section-container">
        <div class="about-header">
            <h1>About Me</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p class="about-lead">
                    I'm James, a Software Engineer based in <strong>Vienna, Austria</strong>.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I see myself as a generalist programmer, with an avid interest in always learning new things.
                    The generalist role as a result is one I seek to continue doing, to keep me interacting with
                    all areas of development.
                </p>
                <p>
                    My career has taken me through the games industry where I've worked on high-profile titles
                    like CSR Racing 2 and Pocket Mortys, to personal projects exploring VR, networking, and
                    mobile development. I thrive in multi-disciplinary environments where I can contribute
                    across the full stack.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Outside of professional work, I enjoy participating in game jams, building personal tools,
                    and contributing to community projects. I believe in using technology to solve real problems
                    and create engaging experiences. I'm also one of the winners of the <strong>SimCorp x Microsoft AI Hackathon 2026</strong>.
                </p>
                <div class="cv-cta">
                    <a href="cv" class="btn btn-primary">View My CV &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-sidebar">
